I turn the key and open the door.
I turn on the light.
I put the suitcase and the rucksack on the floor.
I am very relieved!
I look around.
What is here?
The room is not big.
But it is warm.
There is a bed.
There is also a table and a chair.
On the table is a lamp.
And there is a window.
The window is very tall.
The room is simple, but nice.
I am finally here.
I am in Berlin.
